  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). A cistern eel thick as a mooring rope that lives in the two channels. P1: a lunge from the water, a tail sweep, and it DIVES into a channel — while it is submerged, coils lash up from both channels (stand on the walkway between them). P2 at 50%: it opens the sluice and the floor floods (slowing pools that grow); the Drain lever on the wall empties them and slams the gate on its tail (stun). Soft enrage from 3 min.",
  "party": "Solo: the lunge and the dive coils are the danger; 1 player can pull the drain lever between swings. 2-3: one holds the eel, one works the lever. 5: comfortable; M5 should raise health ~x1.6 for 5 and add a second coil line per extra player.",
